914
00:27:22,080 --> 00:27:23,040
So we know that,

915
00:27:23,040 --> 00:27:25,220
what effect does it actually achieve?

916
00:27:25,220 --> 00:27:27,020
As we explained earlier,

917
00:27:27,020 --> 00:27:28,420
the first step is to take

918
00:27:28,420 --> 00:27:31,740
the value in the register specified by this CSR instruction,

919
00:27:31,740 --> 00:27:33,860
read it out, and put it into rd.

920
00:27:33,860 --> 00:27:36,080
But here, since it's x0,

921
00:27:36,080 --> 00:27:36,840
But for x0,

922
00:27:36,840 --> 00:27:37,900
its value is simply 0.

923
00:27:37,900 --> 00:27:38,500
Think about it —

924
00:27:38,500 --> 00:27:41,660
if we use 0 as the mask to AND it,

925
00:27:41,660 --> 00:27:43,600
will that actually affect

926
00:27:43,600 --> 00:27:45,020
