00:29:20,860 --> 00:29:21,620
Right?

966
00:29:21,620 --> 00:29:23,700
So once we read it,

967
00:29:23,700 --> 00:29:24,660
we can find out who we are.

968
00:29:24,660 --> 00:29:26,300
In other words, reading it tells us who we are.

