972
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,860
and there must be one hart with ID 0.

973
00:29:35,860 --> 00:29:36,980
So in general,

974
00:29:36,980 --> 00:29:38,800
in our hardware implementation,

975
00:29:38,800 --> 00:29:41,140
the first hart ID is 0.

976
00:29:41,140 --> 00:29:43,800
There isn't much ambiguity about this.

977
00:29:43,800 --> 00:29:45,680
Good.

978
00:29:45,680 --> 00:29:47,760
So what we need to do now is

